WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.875
Unit 2 starts with the
settings and preflight.

2
00:00:02.875 --> 00:00:04.823
One settings file per environment,

3
00:00:04.823 --> 00:00:09.094
filled from the template and kept inside
your boundary, names the instance,

4
00:00:09.094 --> 00:00:12.538
its snapshots, the exception
registry, the reviewed mapping,

5
00:00:12.538 --> 00:00:15.087
the evidence chain and
the break-glass group.

6
00:00:15.087 --> 00:00:16.638
No secret goes in it.

7
00:00:16.638 --> 00:00:18.675
Preflight then checks seven things.

8
00:00:18.675 --> 00:00:21.363
P F oh one, the settings are complete.

9
00:00:21.363 --> 00:00:23.467
Oh two, the cloud is Azure Cloud,

10
00:00:23.467 --> 00:00:28.263
the commercial cloud where a G C C
Moderate tenant's Arc resources are.

11
00:00:28.263 --> 00:00:31.862
Oh three, the instance is in
Arc-eligibility Category 1.

12
00:00:31.862 --> 00:00:34.763
Oh four, the mapping resolves every login.

13
00:00:34.763 --> 00:00:38.513
Oh five, the break-glass path
is in the exception registry.

14
00:00:38.513 --> 00:00:40.178
Oh six, for production only,

15
00:00:40.178 --> 00:00:44.113
a sealed test stage for the same
instance that isn't a rehearsal.

16
00:00:44.113 --> 00:00:47.248
And oh seven, the S A
account disabled and renamed,

17
00:00:47.248 --> 00:00:50.149
which is a warning and
doesn't stop the change.

18
00:00:50.149 --> 00:00:52.465
Preflight can't see the deployer's rights,

19
00:00:52.465 --> 00:00:55.462
so the deployer reads them
after activating the role.
